    "title": "Family Crisis Center now has four forensic interviewers on staff - NewsBreak",
    "text": "16 hours ago Up until a few weeks ago, Kayla Bailey was the only trained forensic interviewer on staff at the Family Crisis Center (FCC). She is thankful things have changed. As the FCC’s Child Advocacy Center program director, Bailey now has extra support because three of her colleagues were recently trained to conduct forensic interviews, mainly with children who have been sexually abused. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
